  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "start": 986.0,
      "end": 990.41,
      "local_start": 0.25,
      "local_end": 4.66,
      "first_word_id": "W002781",
      "last_word_id": "W002791",
      "text": "Something here is genuinely hard, and it is not the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 991.08,
      "end": 999.02,
      "local_start": 5.33,
      "local_end": 13.27,
      "first_word_id": "W002792",
      "last_word_id": "W002815",
      "text": "It is that you are asking somebody to pay you today for something that pays off at an event with no date on it."
    },
    {
      "start": 999.1,
      "end": 1002.88,
      "local_start": 13.35,
      "local_end": 17.13,
      "first_word_id": "W002816",
      "last_word_id": "W002825",
      "text": "Every business this resembles has a deadline doing the selling."
    },
    {
      "start": 1002.92,
      "end": 1004.02,
      "local_start": 17.17,
      "local_end": 18.27,
      "first_word_id": "W002826",
      "last_word_id": "W002829",
      "text": "The audit is booked."
    },
    {
      "start": 1004.14,
      "end": 1005.78,
      "local_start": 18.39,
      "local_end": 20.03,
      "first_word_id": "W002830",
      "last_word_id": "W002833",
      "text": "The inspection is scheduled."
    },
    {
      "start": 1006.3,
      "end": 1007.3,
      "local_start": 20.55,
      "local_end": 21.55,
      "first_word_id": "W002834",
      "last_word_id": "W002838",
      "text": "You do not have that."
    },
    {
      "start": 1008.34,
      "end": 1011.7,
      "local_start": 22.59,
      "local_end": 25.95,
      "first_word_id": "W002839",
      "last_word_id": "W002849",
      "text": "What you have instead is the thing we talked about earlier."
    },
    {
      "start": 1011.82,
      "end": 1013.97,
      "local_start": 26.07,
      "local_end": 28.22,
      "first_word_id": "W002850",
      "last_word_id": "W002857",
      "text": "About half of these exits are not planned."
    },
    {
      "start": 1014.64,
      "end": 1018.0,
      "local_start": 28.89,
      "local_end": 32.25,
      "first_word_id": "W002858",
      "last_word_id": "W002867",
      "text": "So the argument is not get ready for your exit."
    },
    {
      "start": 1018.01,
      "end": 1022.78,
      "local_start": 32.26,
      "local_end": 37.03,
      "first_word_id": "W002868",
      "last_word_id": "W002878",
      "text": "The argument is that half the time nobody gets a warning."
    },
    {
      "start": 1023.02,
      "end": 1025.099,
      "local_start": 37.27,
      "local_end": 39.349,
      "first_word_id": "W002879",
      "last_word_id": "W002883",
      "text": "That is a real argument."
    },
    {
      "start": 1025.14,
      "end": 1029.8,
      "local_start": 39.39,
      "local_end": 44.05,
      "first_word_id": "W002884",
      "last_word_id": "W002904",
      "text": "It is also a weaker one than a date on a calendar, and I am not going to dress it up."
    },
    {
      "start": 1030.48,
      "end": 1033.54,
      "local_start": 44.73,
      "local_end": 47.79,
      "first_word_id": "W002905",
      "last_word_id": "W002913",
      "text": "So there are two things that would kill this."
    },
    {
      "start": 1034.36,
      "end": 1037.62,
      "local_start": 48.61,
      "local_end": 51.87,
      "first_word_id": "W002914",
      "last_word_id": "W002922",
      "text": "Owners who agree with every word and still defer."
    },
    {
      "start": 1038.52,
      "end": 1042.3,
      "local_start": 52.77,
      "local_end": 56.55,
      "first_word_id": "W002923",
      "last_word_id": "W002930",
      "text": "And brokers who already do it for free."
    },
    {
      "start": 1042.36,
      "end": 1046.599,
      "local_start": 56.61,
      "local_end": 60.849,
      "first_word_id": "W002931",
      "last_word_id": "W002943",
      "text": "If either one is true where you are, you should not build this."
    }
  ],
